From: AzediZ <145237384+AzediZ@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Thu, 15 Oct 2026 19:53:42 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 88/91] Incursion staging sites and mothership loot

The staging system now gets the four scout sites from the 2011 wiki:
Distress Beacon, Forward Reconnaissance Outpost, Propaganda Cluster and
Nation Industrial Proxy. Each pays 50,000 ISK and 50 CONCORD LP and
leaves influence alone. They have no gates, so the waves come in on the
beacon's grid. The Industrial Proxy sits at an asteroid belt with a
beacon that only shows on grid, and greets you with a transmission.
Up to five run at once (StagingSites in the incursion section).

The motherships now drop one to three True Sansha modules and a
blueprint copy of a Shadow, Succubus, Phantasm or Nightmare. Uroborus
in low-sec can drop the Revenant instead. CCP never published the
chances, so the counts, the 1 in 10 Revenant and the runs are picks.

Mothership checks now name the two motherships instead of testing for
site IDs of 10 and up, which the new sites would have tripped.
